{"sections":[{"slug":"Kodaira--Serre对偶","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Kodaira--Serre对偶"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Kodaira–Serre <span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Kodaira–Serre 对偶”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $m$ <span lang=\"zh\">维复流形</span>, $E\\to M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/全纯向量丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">全纯向量丛</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">其对偶</span> $E^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">也是全纯向量丛</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\alpha\\in\\wedge^{p,q}(E)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是光滑</span> $(p,q)$-<span lang=\"zh\">形式</span>, $\\beta \\in \\wedge^{m-p,m-q}(E^*)$, <span lang=\"zh\">取其外积</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">求值得</span> $\\langle\\alpha\\wedge\\beta\\rangle \\in \\wedge^{m,m}(M)$, <span lang=\"zh\">再积分得</span>\n$$\r\n(\\alpha,\\beta):= \\int_M \\langle \\alpha\\wedge\\beta \\rangle.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">可以证明这个配对给出了同构</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathcal A^{m-p,m-q}(E^*) \\simeq \\mathcal A^{p,q}(E)^*.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">进一步</span>,\n$$\r\n\\mathcal H^{p,q}_{\\bar\\partial}(M,E) \\simeq \\mathcal H^{m-p,m-q}(M, E^*) ^*.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $p=0$ <span lang=\"zh\">的特殊情形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">有</span>\n$$\r\nH^q(M,\\mathcal O(E)) \\simeq H^{m-q}(M,\\mathcal O(E^*\\otimes K_M)),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $O(E^*\\otimes K_M)$ <span lang=\"zh\">正是</span> $\\Omega^m(E^*)$.</p>\n"}]}}}]}